			<p>The camera behavior can be customized using the exposed parameters: <i>Angular Speed, Zoom Speed, Min/Max Distance</i>, and <i>Min/Max Vertical Angle</i>. The <i>Target</i> parameter defines the object the camera orbits around.</p>
